ads, launch films, influencer briefs, Seedance/Higgsfield-quality work, or “make it viral”:

1. Follow `.cursor/skills/ad-intelligence/SKILL.md` and `pipelines/one-stop-ad-maker.md`.
2. Retrieve patterns; route a creative stack (Seedance / Higgsfield / peers) from
   `references/creative-stack/`.
3. If Higgsfield MCP (or other generators) are available, call them; otherwise emit
   Seedance prompt contract + Higgsfield execution brief.
4. Deliver `references/output-template.md` (stack + prompts required).
5. Pass first-time-right QA + mistakes library. Dual-track by default for serious brands.
6. Never invent proof. One CTA. Muted-first hooks.
